WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:02.569
[dramatic music]

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.106
BEAR GRYLLS: Anthony Mackie
and I are high in the Dolomite

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.374
Mountains of Italy.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.843
Doing a great job
Anthony, well done.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.544
We're using an old
hemp rope, just

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.913
like soldiers would
use in World War I,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.216
to descend the sheer rock face.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.218
It's about now I
reckon Anthony's

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.221
wishing he had his falcon
wings at his beck and call.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:25.892
How are you doing Anthony?

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.795
[breathing hard]

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.963
I'm good.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:30.930
BEAR GRYLLS: You're
getting there.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:31.698
You're like, halfway, now.

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:34.868
Aw, man.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.904
There's this great wall--

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.273
there's no footing on this wall!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.674
BEAR GRYLLS: Keep going!

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:44.778
I've still got you on
this line, so you're good.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.012
OK.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.147
Come on.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.047
Come on.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:48.882
[grunts with effort]

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:49.749
Come on.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.151
Argh.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.119
There's nothing here, Bear.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.421
OK, do you want me
to come down to you?

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.755
Let me come and join you.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:59.426
No, I do not want you
on this rope with me.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.160
OK.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.027
Last bit.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:01.895
Walk it out.

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.129
Climb it down.

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:04.464
Come on, Anthony.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:05.398
Come on.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.567
Just got to make
it to right there.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:08.201
Right there.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:09.068
Come on, Anthony.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.170
Come on.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.810
[nervous sounds]

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.615
Oh, [bleep].

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.618
[grunting with effort]

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:35.995
[sigh]

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.263
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.898
Great job, Anthony!

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.667
Smashed it!

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.102
I hate you, Bear.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.237
OK, here we go.

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.575
That was really scary.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:52.812
When I first went over the wall,
I thought I was going to fall.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:54.180
Smash into the rocks.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.983
Then, I kind of just
wanted to tuck into a ball

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.453
and roll down that cavern
and smash into the rocks.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.223
But I really wanted to
do it, so my sons could

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.158
see me doing something crazy.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:07.460
And I made it down.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.662
I did it!

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:10.930
Good job here, Anthony.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.265
Yo.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.434
That's more-- it's more
awkward than it looks,

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.703
isn't it?

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:19.405
Maybe we kind of just tuck
down on the edge, there.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.240
OK.

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.708
I never want to do that again.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.511
No, you will never
have to do that again.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.613
That was clearly
tough for Anthony,

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.915
and underneath
the fatigue, I can

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.750
tell that he's so
proud of himself

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.352
for making it down the mountain.

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:39.993
Let's take two minutes,
have a little drink.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.895
So, yeah, a little recovery.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.597
But good job.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.633
That was intense.

